{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S11、S12等短停留段仍安排了较多逐条出现的感受提示，容易让观众来不及扫完；X的并列短词在这些段落更容易快速掠读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句通过加亮形成了清晰的视觉入口，观众即使不逐字阅读，也能抓住人物每一阶段的关键变化；感受提示按音乐进程排列并标明出现时机，更容易边听边对应，而不是面对一堆需要自行归类的词。更重要的是，Y把舍不得、受过的气、害怕孤单、不愿回头和决定继续生活之间的心理因果连接得更清楚，音乐感受也有更具体的力度、节奏、音色和身体反应描述。X的并列布局有快速浏览的优势，但右侧感受容易成为缺少先后关系的词语集合，人物心理与音乐进程之间的对应不够鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8ae6441-d94c-4502-85c1-53b1deb6668b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052957238746Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:30:51.805513+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "803a791f532b65147484162c24fb67e548126350fc9c2b4a8cbd93c112e35270", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f99